<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal">Dear <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;&lt;Insert BPL Name&gt;&gt;</span>,<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><a name="_Hlk42602260">Thank you for your partnership as we
continue to experience staff shortages</a>.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal">Though
your blood drive has been affected, please know your role as a Blood Program
Leader remains invaluable, as you continue to make an impact on the lives of so
many patients and their loved ones.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal">We are
actively working to hire more staff and are doing everything we can to keep
blood drives as planned. Balancing blood drives with patient need is a daily
effort that requires assessing available resources to make the best choices to
protect patient care, our volunteer partners and staff.<span style="color:red"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><b><u>There are
still ways you can help! <o:p></o:p></u></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in;
     mso-add-space:auto;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b>Reschedule
     your blood drive:</b> I’d love to discuss a new date for your
     blood drive.&nbsp;</li></ul><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in;
     mso-add-space:auto;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b>Donate blood, if eligible:</b> To make an appointment or to learn more, download
     the <a href="http://www.redcrossblood.org/bloodapp">American
     Red Cross Blood Donor App</a>, visit <a href="http://www.redcrossblood.org">RedCrossBlood.org</a>,
     call 1-800-RED CROSS (1-800-733-2767) or enable <span class="normaltextrun">the Blood Donor Skill on any Alexa Echo device.</span>&nbsp;</li></ul><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:0in;
     mso-add-space:auto;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b>Support
     local blood drives:</b> We also have locations where we are
     still able to run with our limited resources and would appreciate your
     support in sharing drive opportunities with your network.&nbsp;</li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:1.0in;line-height:normal"><b>Drive(s) Near You:<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:1.0in;line-height:normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;
mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">Drive
Name:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:1.0in;line-height:normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;
mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">Location:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:1.0in;line-height:normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;
mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">Date:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:1.0in;line-height:normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;
mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">Time:</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal">Thank you
so much for your continued support of the Red Cross as we work to deliver our
mission. Your impact continues to make a difference for individuals like <a href="https://youtu.be/eSTmMw20qKE">Kelly and Thor</a>.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/eSTmMw20qKE?feature=oembed"><span style="color: windowtext; text-decoration-line: none;"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype id="_x0000_t75" coordsize="21600,21600"
 o:spt="75" o:preferrelative="t" path="m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe" filled="f"
 stroked="f">
 <v:stroke joinstyle="miter"/>
 <v:formulas>
  <v:f eqn="if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0"/>
  <v:f eqn="sum @0 1 0"/>
  <v:f eqn="sum 0 0 @1"/>
  <v:f eqn="prod @2 1 2"/>
  <v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelWidth"/>
  <v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelHeight"/>
  <v:f eqn="sum @0 0 1"/>
  <v:f eqn="prod @6 1 2"/>
  <v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelWidth"/>
  <v:f eqn="sum @8 21600 0"/>
  <v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelHeight"/>
  <v:f eqn="sum @10 21600 0"/>
